name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q8_2026-pilot'

question 'An AI generates a news article that is written clearly and includes realistic-sounding facts. A student assumes it must be accurate because it sounds so professional. What mistake is the student making?'

wrong 'The student is right — a professionally written article is always trustworthy.'
wrong 'The student should only trust AI news articles if they are very short.'
wrong 'The student is confused about the difference between AI and search engines.'
right 'The student is confusing how convincing something sounds with whether it is actually accurate.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

